      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "一米百八拾八石四斗六升五合四勺壹才"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "一、米 百八十八石四斗六升五合四勺一才"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Item: rice, 188 koku 4 to 6 sho 5 go 4 shaku 1 sai. The note in the next column identifies this as the allowance shared by forty-one interpreters and town officials."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "通辨町役給米"
      }
    ],
