  {
    "id": "anno-izuhara_upper_p019_left-01",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但朝鮮國通辨之者并町役共四拾壹人給米相與候分尤渡方異同有"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、朝鮮國通辨の者ならびに町役、共に四十一人へ給米相與へ候分。尤も渡し方異同これ有り"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: this is the portion of rice granted to forty-one men in all, the Korean-language interpreters together with the town officials, though the manner of delivery varies. (The sentence finishes in the next column.)"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "但書朝鮮國通辨給米"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
