  {
    "id": "anno-izuhara_upper_p019_left-14",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "一錢三千三拾四拾四貫七百四拾八文"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "一、錢 三千三百四十四貫七百四十八文（印刷は「三千三拾四拾四貫」、校訂註「百ヵ」による）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Item: copper cash, 3,344 kan 748 mon. The numeral as printed reads 三千三拾四拾四貫, which is malformed; the 1928 editor's marginal 百ヵ beside the first 拾 emends it to 三千三百四拾四貫, and the parsed value follows that emendation."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "參判使入費錢"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
