        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、參判使在館中の諸入費、且つ往來入用共、平均にして斯くの如し"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: the sundry expenses of the Sanpanshi while resident at the Japan House, together with the outlays for the journey out and back, come to the above as an average."
